<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the panhandle area Monday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 300 head slaughter steers and no heifers; 7,900 head sold for the week to date.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers Pen Select and Choice 2-3 1150 lbs 65.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:     300   Week Ago:    900   Year Ago: Holiday</p>
<p>Wk to date:  7,900   Week Ago: 25,600   Year Ago: 36,800</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
